{
  "about": "检查新版本通知、更新说明的滚动与关闭、测量期间关闭后的页面操作，以及运行新任务表单。用 150% 系统缩放与 101%、112% 软件缩放的合成比例，核对更新日志和快捷键说明的正文滚动位置 dialog.scrollY。",
  "window": [1240, 900],
  "steps": [
    {"note":"The update notice uses the normal action handler, with fixture data."},
    {"control":{"data":{"updates":{"state":"available","version":"9.9.9","notes":"# Update details\n\n**Process monitoring** keeps the current readings visible while the interface refreshes.\n\n**Rendering** preserves chart positions and text layout across repeated redraws.\n\n**Storage** reads device health information when the details page opens.\n\n**Window layout** keeps the reader centred while asynchronous Markdown content is measured.\n\n**Scrolling** uses the page wheel animation while the footer stays fixed.\n\n**Text emphasis** retains bold labels alongside regular paragraphs and inline `code`.\n\n**Compatibility** retains unknown readings when the device does not provide them.","releases":[]}},"updateNotice":true},"wait":450},
    {"control":{"clickAnchor":"toast-action-1-0"},"wait":1200,"inspect":"layout","label":"offer-visible","expect":{"dialog.kind":"update","dialog.ready":true,"dialog.centered":true},"capture":"offer"},
    {"control":{"keys":["escape"]},"wait":350,"inspect":"layout","label":"offer-closed","expect":{"dialog":null}},
    {"control":{"dialog":"whatsnew"},"wait":1200,"inspect":"layout","label":"notes-visible","expect":{"dialog.kind":"whatsnew","dialog.ready":true,"dialog.centered":true}},
    {"control":{"scrollTrace":700},"wait":30},
    {"control":{"wheel":{"x":620,"y":550,"lines":-5}},"wait":450,"capture":"notes-scrolled"},
    {"control":{"keys":["escape"]},"wait":350,"inspect":"layout","label":"notes-closed","expect":{"dialog":null}},
    {"control":{"dialog":"whatsnew","keys":["escape"]},"wait":450,"inspect":"layout","label":"closed-during-measurement","expect":{"dialog":null}},
    {"control":{"mouse":{"type":"move","x":402,"y":72}},"wait":20},
    {"control":{"mouse":{"type":"down","x":402,"y":72}},"wait":20},
    {"control":{"mouse":{"type":"up","x":402,"y":72}},"wait":300,"inspect":"layout","label":"page-responsive","expect":{"page":"settings","dialog":null}},
    {"control":{"dialog":"task"},"wait":400,"inspect":"layout","label":"form-visible","expect":{"dialog.kind":"task","dialog.ready":true}},
    {"control":{"keys":["escape"]},"wait":350,"inspect":"layout","label":"form-closed","expect":{"dialog":null}},
    {"probe":"size 1496 1035","control":{"contentZoom":1.515},"wait":600},
    {"control":{"dialog":"whatsnew"},"wait":900,"inspect":"layout","label":"fractional-notes-open","expect":{"dialog.ready":true,"dialog.scrollY":0}},
    {"control":{"wheel":{"x":350,"y":180,"lines":-4}},"wait":500,"inspect":"layout","label":"fractional-notes-scrolled","expect":{"dialog.kind":"whatsnew"},"expectNot":{"dialog.scrollY":0}},
    {"control":{"wheel":{"x":350,"y":180,"lines":600}},"wait":650,"inspect":"layout","label":"fractional-notes-top","expect":{"dialog.scrollY":0}},
    {"control":{"keys":["escape"]},"wait":350},
    {"control":{"contentZoom":1.68},"wait":500},
    {"control":{"dialog":"shortcuts"},"wait":800,"inspect":"layout","label":"fractional-shortcuts-open","expect":{"dialog.ready":true,"dialog.scrollY":0}},
    {"control":{"wheel":{"x":350,"y":180,"lines":-4}},"wait":500,"inspect":"layout","label":"fractional-shortcuts-scrolled","expect":{"dialog.kind":"shortcuts"},"expectNot":{"dialog.scrollY":0}},
    {"control":{"wheel":{"x":350,"y":180,"lines":600}},"wait":650,"inspect":"layout","label":"fractional-shortcuts-top","expect":{"dialog.scrollY":0}}
  ]
}
